    {
      "content": "Hi, yeah, I do have your estimate here whisky, although you know what I kinda wanna quickly go over a few things with you. Well number one is as far as our hour the rate goes, we have different hour rates for each day of the week and Friday to Sunday tends to be the more expensive days. So, if you're a little bit flexible, we have cheaper rates available for, for weekdays which is Monday through Thursday. And I can definitely get you like the difference between the numbers.",
