      "time": "2026-09-17T21:49:47.897765",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "One second and so.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-09-17T21:49:49.072613",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "As far as the hour rate goes, basically the hour, the rate for the weekend is $103 per hour per mover. The hour rate for a weekday is $97 per hour per mover and that hour the rate includes, you know, the gas, the truck taxes and insurance. We will also bring our own tools for any disassemble or reassembly of the furniture. Of course and we're gonna wrap up the furniture in moving blankets, insurance copy for moving them. So they're kind of protected and also with before the M the decor, the paintings, wall art and everything. We're also gonna wrap them in moving blankets, insurance wrap.",
